From 35581b0264280ea95064b555aa2badd094677a7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:29:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix schema mismatches, add heartbeat endpoint, email alerts

- New /api/v1/sites/heartbeat endpoint (full nested payload from WP plugin)
- Auto-alerts voor SSL expiry en verouderde PHP versie
- Email via Resend bij site offline, SSL expiry, PHP waarschuwing
- Cron check-offline stuurt nu ook email naar agency owner
- SiteStatus type: pending/maintenance -> unknown/degraded
- Alert type: status + title velden correct
- Update runs, plugin en site detail pagina: correcte DB kolomnamen
- Connector plugin API base URL: api.verploy.com -> app.verploy.com/api/v1

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0138xyUMTBotJMR8DdLUjKQ5
